NOTE ON BUNDLED FONTS

This MIT license covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT cover
the font files in `public/fonts/`, which are third-party works with separate
terms:

  - `aj00.ttf` — "A J Kunheing 00", designer JAO Kunheing (Nawone Sai).
    Embedded copyright is an unfilled template ("Typeface © (your company).
    2022. All Rights Reserved"); no license field is set.
  - `aj12.ttf` — "AJ 12", Copyright (c) 2024 by Jao Kunheing.
    Embedded license reads "All rights reserved."

Neither font currently grants redistribution rights. Resolving this is tracked
as PBI-001 and blocks publishing this repository. Do not redistribute these
files until permission is obtained in writing, ideally under the SIL Open Font
License.
